      <h2>Welcome to Paris</h2>
      <p>The City of Light, where art, history, fashion, and gastronomy blend in a timeless atmosphere. Explore the culture, landmarks, and vibrant life of France’s capital.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="landmarks">
      <h2>Iconic Landmarks</h2>
      <p>From the Eiffel Tower and the Louvre Museum to Notre-Dame Cathedral, every street corner tells a story. Paris’ architecture seamlessly merges classic grandeur with modern design.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="culture">
      <h2>Culture & Lifestyle</h2>
      <p>Parisian culture celebrates creativity, conversation, and café life. Whether you’re reading at a corner café or attending an evening ballet at Opéra Garnier, art thrives everywhere.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="nightlife">
      <h2>Nightlife in Paris</h2>
      <p>As the sun sets, the city transforms. Rooftop bars, jazz clubs, and river cruises offer endless possibilities to experience the magic of Paris after dark.</p>
